## Scope: this licence covers the application code only

This MIT licence applies to the Buddadawg application source code in this
repository (`Sources/`, `scripts/`, `Tests/`, and related files). It does
**not** cover the bundled speech-recognition model weights, which are
separate works governed by their own upstream licences:

- Bark 3.0 Clean weights (`ModelsClean/`) — Fluid Inference Core ML
  conversion of Conway Research's Bark 3.0 Clean. See
  `ModelsClean/NOTICE`. Upstream cards currently display
  CC-BY-NC-4.0 (non-commercial), so the MIT licence here does **not**
  grant any right to use or redistribute those weights commercially.
- Bark 3.0 verbatim weights (`Models/`) — Conway Research
  Underdog-Bark-3.0. See `NOTICE`. Same licence ambiguity; see
  `docs/oss-release-plan.md` §1.1.
- Upstream base models (NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, Moondream
  parakeet-ultra) are CC-BY-4.0, credited in the NOTICE files.

If you redistribute Buddadawg.app, the model weights inside it keep their
own licences and attribution requirements — you cannot relicense them under
MIT. The full provenance and open questions are tracked in
`docs/oss-release-plan.md` §1.
